#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Shield Duel", -1)
$Author: openspace
$Created: 08/02/26 at 00:00:00
$Modified: 08/02/26 at 00:00:00
$Notes:
One ship, head on, for looking at the shield-hit effect. The target is an
SB Seraphim -- 1600 shield points over 500 hull, the deepest shield pool
in the roster, so it soaks sustained fire instead of dying while you
look. It sits still (ai-play-dead) 400m ahead, turned to face the player,
so hits land on its FRONT quadrant; fly around it and the lit patch
should follow you round the hull.

Retail lights the struck section of the shield mesh, not a bubble
(shield.cc get_quadrant: 0 right, 1 front, 2 rear, 3 left).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("A single shielded fighter, standing still", -1)
$end_multi_text

